{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-04_end","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-04","title":"亀裂","storyCode":"3-4","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-04_end.txt","sourceHash":"9bc55b2533cc119c72458beb21bf0b2164144750370376e944e259ab72f76e39","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"痕跡を残さず消えたレユニオン。訝しむロドスの元へ、地下からスカルシュレッダーが襲いかかる。彼の狙いはドクターだ。\nそれを止めようとアーミヤが咄嗟にアーツを使ったことで、スカルシュレッダーはその一撃を食らい、恨み言を口にして命を落とすのだった。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十六关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"どういうこと……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"小隊を一つ潰しただけなのに……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"って言っても、でっかいのはきっちり倒したじゃない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"これで終わりって言ってくれないかしら。あれの相手で疲れてるんだけど。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"そうはいかないでしょうね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"あんなにも多くの感染者たちが、跡形もなくどこかへ消えるとは思えません。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"それに、先ほどの大柄な相手も、単なる囮と考えるには奇妙です。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"そもそも、この短時間で離脱なんてできるものでしょうか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"退路は近衛局が塞いでいるはずですし……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"ここ……何かおかしいとは思うんだけど。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"手がかりは一つも見当たらないのよね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"草地に廃墟、それから砂丘……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"待ち伏せするにはぴったりの場所なのに。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"新しい足跡どころか、衣服が草に擦れる音や、火薬の匂いすらも……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"何一つないだなんて。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"あ～あ。わけわかんないわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"ねえ、ペンギン急便のお二人さんで何とかしてくれない？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"だって、こんな状況、超不自然だし――"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"――静かに。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"何か聞こえます。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"何か、って――ん？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"ひょっとして……地面の下から聞こえてる！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"――アーミヤ！　相手は下だ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ッ！！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"ドクター！　伏せてください！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"この連中……！　なんと姑息な！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"なっ……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"今のを……受け止めた、のか……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我が盾――「般若」を貫くことなど、できはしない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"……それは、どうかな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"――ッ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"何なの、この熱……って、あれは……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"まさか、アーツユニットごと自爆するつもり！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"ドクター、離れて！　その距離じゃ――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"こ、のッ……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_1_lastattack"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"これで……終わりだ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"や……やめて……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ダメ――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ドクターを、傷つけないでっ！！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_1_reflect"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_1_underattack"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_1_lastbreath"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"ぐ、っ……ご、ほっ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……っ、あ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"……なんて……力、だ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"これ、は……一体……何、なんだ……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"…………いや。お前、の……実力、か……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"げほ、っ…………く、そっ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"……こんな、力が……ある、くせにっ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"…………苦、しむ……同胞、たちを……ただ、見過ごす……なんて……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"許、せない……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"……俺は……お前、らを……許、さ……ない……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"………………"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"…………そ……んな……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"いや……い、いやああっ……！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["ミーシャ"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["エクシア"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["フランカ"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["リスカム"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["ホシグマ"]},{"speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","aliases":["スカルシュレッダー","フランカ","ホシグマ"]}]}
